  "transcript": [
    {
      "approx_t": 0.0,
      "text": "How do you know if a moustache looks good on you?"
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 3.0,
      "text": "This clean and thick moustache look is everywhere right now."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 6.0,
      "text": "So here are three ways to check if it'll look great on you."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 8.5,
      "text": "One way to find out is to look at the space between your nose and the upper lip."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 13.0,
      "text": "This is your philtrum."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 15.0,
      "text": "A long or a short philtrum heavily impacts how your face looks."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 19.0,
      "text": "So if you have a visibly long philtrum, a thick moustache can break up that empty space and make your face look more balanced."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 25.5,
      "text": "Second, check your facial features."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 28.0,
      "text": "Research shows that your jaw, eyebrow thickness, and facial height contributes to perceived masculinity."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 34.0,
      "text": "So if you already have strong brows and a defined jaw, but a relatively plain face, a moustache can become a strong focal point."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 41.0,
      "text": "And third, moustache density."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 43.0,
      "text": "This whole look falls flat if your moustache is very sparse."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 46.5,
      "text": "The moustache only produces the right perception if it can grow thick and create a clear horizontal block."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 52.0,
      "text": "Follow for more grooming tips."
    }
  ],
